                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W8101300                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  PACKED LINES PER DC                                   *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  KUMAR LOVISH                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*          
* UPPGIFT: LISTAR ANTALET PACKADE RADER PER SVERIGE LDC OCH          *          
*          SKICKAR DETTA PÅ MAIL TILL KONTAKTPERSONER                *          
*                                                                    *          
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*          
FILE W81013D1                                                                   
%WXTRA0                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W81013D2 FB (142 0)                                                        
%WXTRA0 'SORT-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
FILE W81013D3 FB (36 0)                                                         
A-IDDC        1  2 A                                                            
A-IDDIST      3  4 N                                                            
A-IDPLOCK     7  6 N                                                            
A-TIPACKN    13  6 N                                                            
A-KDORDKL    19  1 N                                                            
A-ADLAGOMR   20  2 N                                                            
A-TALLY      22 10 P 0                                                          
*                                                                               
***************************************************                             
FILE W81013D4 PRINTER VB(61 0)                                                  
*                                                                               
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
*                    WORKING STORAGE                             *              
*----------------------------------------------------------------*              
U-IDPLOCK     W  6 N                                                            
U-TIPACKN     W  6 N                                                            
U-KDORDKL     W  1 N                                                            
U-ADLAGOMR    W  2 N                                                            
U-TALLY       W  7 N 0                                                          
U-DIST        W  4 N VALUE 0                                                    
U-SEM         W  1 A VALUE ';'                                                  
IDDC-PREV     W  2 A                                                            
*                                                                               
SORT W81013D1 TO W81013D2 USING (IDDC IDDISTR)                                  
                                                                                
JOB INPUT W81013D2                                                              
    A-IDDC      = SORT-IDDC                                                     
    A-IDDIST    = SORT-IDDISTR                                                  
    A-IDPLOCK   = SORT-IDPLOCK                                                  
    A-TIPACKN   = SORT-TIPACKN                                                  
    A-KDORDKL   = SORT-KDORDKL                                                  
    A-ADLAGOMR  = SORT-ADLAGOMR                                                 
      PRINT SUM01                                                               
                                                                                
 *                                                                              
   REPORT SUM01 SUMMARY SUMFILE W81013D3 NOPAGE NODATE NOHEADING                
 *                                                                              
   SEQUENCE   A-IDDC A-IDDIST A-IDPLOCK A-TIPACKN +                             
              A-KDORDKL A-ADLAGOMR                                              
 *                                                                              
   CONTROL    A-IDDC NOPRINT A-IDDIST NOPRINT A-IDPLOCK NOPRINT +               
              A-TIPACKN NOPRINT A-KDORDKL NOPRINT A-ADLAGOMR NOPRINT            
 *                                                                              
   LINE       A-IDDC           +                                                
              A-IDDIST         +                                                
              A-IDPLOCK        +                                                
              A-TIPACKN        +                                                
              A-KDORDKL        +                                                
              A-ADLAGOMR       +                                                
              TALLY                                                             
                                                                                
JOB INPUT W81013D3                                                              
     U-IDPLOCK  = A-IDPLOCK                                                     
     U-TIPACKN  = A-TIPACKN                                                     
     U-KDORDKL  = A-KDORDKL                                                     
     U-ADLAGOMR = A-ADLAGOMR                                                    
     U-TALLY    = A-TALLY                                                       
     U-DIST     = A-IDDIST                                                      
      PRINT REPORT1                                                             
                                                                                
 REPORT        REPORT1          +                                               
               PRINTER W81013D4 +                                               
               PAGESIZE 32767   +                                               
               LINESIZE 56      +                                               
               SPACE 0          +                                               
               NOADJUST         +                                               
               NOSPREAD         +                                               
               NOPAGE           +                                               
               NODATE           +                                               
               NOHEADING                                                        
                                                                                
 LINE         U-DIST           +                                                
              U-SEM            +                                                
              U-IDPLOCK        +                                                
              U-SEM            +                                                
              U-TIPACKN        +                                                
              U-SEM            +                                                
              U-KDORDKL        +                                                
              U-SEM            +                                                
              U-ADLAGOMR       +                                                
              U-SEM            +                                                
              U-TALLY          +                                                
              U-SEM            +                                                
                                                                                
BEFORE-LINE. PROC                                                               
 IF IDDC-PREV NE A-IDDC                                                         
   IDDC-PREV = A-IDDC                                                           
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW81013'                                                         
   DISPLAY '¤DAP' IDDC-PREV                                                     
   DISPLAY 'DIST;PICKER;DATE;ORDER CLASS;WAREHOUSE AREA;NO.OF LINES;'           
                                                                                
 END-IF                                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
